{"id":"01_5940","type":"item","name":{"ja":"30MS 天海春香 (20th Anniv. YOU AND アイ！)","en":"30MS Haruka Amami (20th Anniv. YOU AND Ai!)"},"description":[{"ja":"「アイドルマスター」より「天海春香」を30MSフォーマットで立体化！20周年記念衣装「ＹＯＵ ＡＮＤ アイ！」と全身のパーツが同梱されているオールインワンアイテム。","en":"\"Haruka Amami \" from \" THE IDOLM@STER \" is made into 3D in 30MS format! An all-in-one item that includes the 20th lap commemorative costume \" YOU AND I!\" and full body parts."},{"ja":"• 髪飾りパーツは20周年記念衣装のデザインとオリジナルデザインの2種類が付属。","en":"• Two types of hair ornament parts are included: a 20th anniversary costume design and an original design."},{"ja":"• 表情パーツはタンポ印刷を施した3種類が付属。口の中の色分けはパーツ分割で再現。","en":"• Three types of facial expression parts with tampo printing are included. The color coding inside the mouth is reproduced by dividing the parts."},{"ja":"• 衣装は髪飾りや襟元など、細部にクリアパーツを採用し、そのまま組み立てるだけでカラフルな色分けや精密なディテールを再現。","en":"• The costume uses clear parts for details such as hair ornaments and collars, and reproduces colorful color coding and precise details just by assembling."},{"ja":"• スカートは模様をプリントしたシートで再現。","en":"• The skirt is reproduced with a sheet with a pattern printed on it."},{"ja":"• 肌パーツや衣装は仕上げの際に金型表面に艶消し処理を施し、柔らかく光を反射する演出がされている。","en":"• When finishing the skin parts and costumes, a matte treatment is applied to the mold surface to create a soft, light-reflecting effect."},{"ja":"• 表情付きハンドパーツに加えマイクが保持できるハンドパーツが付属。","en":"• In addition to hand parts with facial expressions, hand parts that can hold a microphone are included."}],"accessories":[{"ja":"フェイスパーツ(タンポ印刷)×3種","en":"Face parts (tampo printing) x 3 types"},{"ja":"ハンドパーツ×1式","en":"Hand parts x 1 set"},{"ja":"髪パーツ×1式","en":"Hair parts x 1 set"},{"ja":"マイク×1","en":"Microphone x 1"}],"contents":[],"images":["https://d3bk8pkqsprcvh.cloudfront.net/hobby/jp/product/2025/07/vkJsqvJV5a7aonfd/UQI427H1oiZ15CBL.jpg?Expires=1765044112&Key-Pair-Id=K7AVJM1114TH7&Signature=a5MeLI0kfBmdP26t7N-4xRh~jMbxRChm15lWD2oi0bWS7NzdlgTsJK6kAfKAigWhbEU8BWZAZl89g-8mSiMkuJjPrrO4HUlJdBw67hUYFi